<title>USA: PECO to repurchase up to 20 mln shares.</title>
<headline>PECO to repurchase up to 20 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PECO Energy Co said Monday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 20 million common shares from time to time in open market, privately negotiated or other types of transactions.</p>
<p>This authorization is in addition to the authorization granted by the board in April to repurchase up to five million shares.</p>
</text>
